sequenceDiagram
    participant PM as Project Manager
    participant UI as Web Interface
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant AUTH as Auth Service
    participant PS as Project Service
    participant FS as File Service
    participant VS as Validation Service
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant AS as Audit Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant CACHE as Redis Cache
    
    Note over PM,CACHE: Project Creation Workflow
    
    PM->>UI: Navigate to Create Project
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/auth/me (verify session)
    API->>AUTH: Validate JWT token
    AUTH-->>API: Return user details
    API-->>UI: Return authenticated user
    UI-->>PM: Display create project form
    
    PM->>UI: Fill project metadata
    Note over PM,UI: Name, Type, Dates, Geography
    
    PM->>UI: Click "Next" to upload facilities
    UI->>VS: Validate project metadata
    VS-->>UI: Return validation results
    
    alt Validation Failed
        UI-->>PM: Show validation errors
        PM->>UI: Correct errors and resubmit
    end
    
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/projects/validate (pre-validation)
    API->>PS: Forward validation request
    PS->>VS: Validate business rules
    
    alt Duplicate Project Name
        VS->>DB: Check project name uniqueness
        DB-->>VS: Return duplicate check
        VS-->>PS: Return validation error
        PS-->>API: Return error response
        API-->>UI: Return validation error
        UI-->>PM: Show "Project name exists" error
    else Validation Success
        VS-->>PS: Validation passed
        PS-->>API: Pre-validation successful
        API-->>UI: Show facility upload interface
    end
    
    PM->>UI: Download facility template
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/projects/facility-template
    API->>FS: Generate Excel template
    FS->>DB: Fetch boundary data for dropdown
    DB-->>FS: Return boundary hierarchy
    FS-->>API: Return Excel template with dropdowns
    API-->>UI: Download template file
    UI-->>PM: Template downloaded
    
    PM->>PM: Fill facility data in Excel
    PM->>UI: Upload completed facility file
    
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/projects/facilities/upload (multipart)
    API->>FS: Store uploaded file temporarily
    FS-->>API: Return file reference
    
    API->>PS: Process facility upload
    PS->>VS: Validate Excel format
    
    alt Invalid Excel Format
        VS-->>PS: Format validation failed
        PS-->>API: Return format error
        API-->>UI: Show format error
        UI-->>PM: "Invalid file format, use template"
    else Valid Format
        VS-->>PS: Format validation passed
        PS->>PS: Process facilities asynchronously
        PS-->>API: Return upload accepted
        API-->>UI: Show "Processing..." message
    end
    
    Note over PS,DB: Async Facility Processing
    
    loop For each facility row
        PS->>VS: Validate facility data
        VS->>DB: Validate boundary codes
        DB-->>VS: Return boundary validation
        VS->>VS: Validate contact info format
        VS->>VS: Check required fields
        
        alt Validation Error
            VS-->>PS: Add to error list
        else Valid Facility
            PS->>DB: Check for duplicates
            DB-->>PS: Return duplicate check
            alt No Duplicate
                PS->>PS: Add to valid facilities list
            else Duplicate Found
                PS->>PS: Add to error list
            end
        end
    end
    
    PS->>FS: Generate error report if errors exist
    FS-->>PS: Return error report URL
    
    alt Validation Errors Found
        PS->>NS: Send error notification
        NS->>UI: Push notification (WebSocket)
        UI-->>PM: Show "Upload failed, download error report"
        PM->>UI: Download error report
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/files/{errorReportId}
        API->>FS: Retrieve error report
        FS-->>API: Return error report file
        API-->>UI: Download error report
        UI-->>PM: Error report downloaded
        
        PM->>PM: Fix errors in Excel
        PM->>UI: Re-upload corrected file
        Note over PM,UI: Process repeats until no errors
        
    else No Validation Errors
        PS->>DB: Begin transaction
        PS->>DB: Create project record
        DB-->>PS: Return project ID
        
        loop For each valid facility
            PS->>DB: Create health facility record
            DB-->>PS: Return facility ID
            PS->>DB: Link facility to project
            DB-->>PS: Confirm association
        end
        
        PS->>DB: Commit transaction
        DB-->>PS: Transaction committed
        
        PS->>AS: Log project creation audit
        AS->>DB: Store audit record
        DB-->>AS: Audit logged
        
        PS->>CACHE: Cache project data
        CACHE-->>PS: Data cached
        
        PS->>NS: Send success notification
        NS->>UI: Push notification (WebSocket)
        UI-->>PM: Show "Project created successfully"
        
        PS->>NS: Send email to stakeholders
        NS->>NS: Queue email notification
        
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/projects/{projectId}
        API->>PS: Fetch created project
        PS->>CACHE: Check cache first
        
        alt Cache Hit
            CACHE-->>PS: Return cached project
        else Cache Miss
            PS->>DB: Query project details
            DB-->>PS: Return project with facilities
            PS->>CACHE: Update cache
        end
        
        PS-->>API: Return project details
        API-->>UI: Return project data
        UI-->>PM: Display created project summary
    end
    
    Note over PM,CACHE: Project successfully created with facilities 